---
description: Test discipline
globs:
  - crates/**/tests/**/*.rs
  - crates/**/src/**/*.rs
alwaysApply: false
---

- Snapshots: `insta`. Reviewed in the PR that adds them.
- Property: `proptest`; regressions committed.
- Integration: crates/<c>/tests/.
- CLI: `assert_cmd` fixtures.
- Shared helpers: crates/<c>/tests/support/ — never duplicated.
- Fuzz targets: crates/<c>/fuzz/fuzz_targets/.
